   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Layout only, no colors, no style. Phone first; the computer rearranges the same blocks. Texts from specs.md, in English, with the first screen in French to check its longer texts.\nGrey boxes stand in for the video and the screenshots. Dashed line: where the first screen ends. Every block is a group: click to move it, double-click to edit it.",
   "originalText": "Layout only, no colors, no style. Phone first; the computer rearranges the same blocks. Texts from specs.md, in English, with the first screen in French to check its longer texts.\nGrey boxes stand in for the video and the screenshots. Dashed line: where the first screen ends. Every block is a group: click to move it, double-click to edit it.",
